name: sim.getScriptAttribute
description: 
luaSynopsis: number/bool attribute=sim.getScriptAttribute(int scriptHandle,int attributeID)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. scriptHandle: handle of a script
2. attributeID: the script attributeID
3. floatVal: pointer to a floating point value, receiving the floating point attribute (if applicable)
4. intOrBoolVal: pointer to an integer value, receiving the integer or bool attribute (if applicable)
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. attribute: the requested attribute value
